# The TOWERS input kernel recomputes the cell geometry only when the cell
# changes (D[towers-input-geometry]): under a barostat that compresses the
# cell, a run continued from a checkpoint, which starts without a geometry,
# matches the uninterrupted run, in a rectangular and a triclinic cell, with
# LAUNCH and GRAPH.
# REQUIRES: cuda, towers-mma, hdf5, h5py
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir %t
# RUN: %h5md_python %S/Inputs/check_towers_input_geometry.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide %t mdir | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: rectangular: volume change
# CHECK: triclinic: volume change
# CHECK: triclinic graph: volume change
# CHECK: towers input geometry: ok
